{"approved":false,"format":"usefulverse-quality-refinement-v1","native_review":false,"policy_digest":"0eeb566720322555f829a5a3be61f81c3c9d73a716a9e31c6a7419feb1ff5a59","primary_audit_digest":"b9b6e5b7d7979e243a311ebe3f7051bdc8c587dddb2825dab372ec97d3974eb2","proposals":[{"audit":{"approved":false,"auto_usable":false,"back_translation":"Estimate only. The air core model uses a single-layer Wheeler approximation and is an approximate reference when the coil diameter is less than the winding length 3 ×. It does not take into account wire thickness, distance, nearby metal, frequency, parasitic capacitance and measurement conditions. For toroidal, enter the coefficient AL from its accurate core data sheet; AL and permeability may vary with frequency, temperature, DC deviation, gap and manufacturing tolerance.","back_truncated":false,"format":"usefulverse-semantic-audit-v1","native_review":false,"policy":{"allows_publication":false,"claims_native_quality":false,"embedding":{"license":"MIT","repository":"intfloat/multilingual-e5-small","revision":"614241f622f53c4eeff9890bdc4f31cfecc418b3"},"max_tokens":512,"maximum_contradiction":0.2,"minimum_entailment":0.6,"minimum_similarity":0.8,"nli":{"license":"Apache-2.0","repository":"cross-encoder/nli-deberta-v3-small","revision":"fa2804872c3b4bd748f38c0185cc85775361e735"},"version":"semantic-screen-1"},"policy_digest":"36421db300bb5b4775311d883e0717d9efadde33b6766e5fd6d698175f610ed0","raw_digest":"f40396525585f75ff43e094bcaf54eef5020d0c1d2980721d7a690c95e4976ee","reasons":["forward:back_negation","meaning_not_preserved_both_ways","negation"],"record_id":"10d366ebce52739133f9f04a9a428f5420525349130ac5ff39973e475b0eefa3","scores":{"forward_contradiction":0.0003759193350560963,"forward_entailment":0.9956550598144531,"reverse_contradiction":0.0006970402901060879,"reverse_entailment":0.007404461037367582,"similarity":0.8867315649986267}},"candidate":{"back_sample":{"translation":"Estimate only. The air core model uses a single-layer Wheeler approximation and is an approximate reference when the coil diameter is less than the winding length 3 ×. It does not take into account wire thickness, distance, nearby metal, frequency, parasitic capacitance and measurement conditions. For toroidal, enter the coefficient AL from its accurate core data sheet; AL and permeability may vary with frequency, temperature, DC deviation, gap and manufacturing tolerance.","truncated":false},"beam_size":4,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"inductor-calculator UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"ru","format":"usefulverse-refinement-candidate-v1","key":"inductor-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["inductor-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"ru","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","parent_digest":"a72b12c46d8de8ca94be04afcd042bfcd5d1abdd2871eaf2166cc35bc7976ba2","raw_translation":"Только оценка. Модель воздушного сердечника использует однослойную аппроксимацию Уилера и является приблизительным ориентиром, когда диаметр катушки меньше длины обмотки ZXQPH0000QXZ ×. Она не учитывает толщину проволоки, расстояние, близлежащий металл, частоту, паразитную емкость и условия измерения. Для тороидального, введите коэффициент AL из его точного листа данных сердечника; AL и проницаемость могут изменяться с частотой, температурой, отклонением постоянного тока, зазором и допуском производства. Проверьте любую реальную конструкцию с производителем сердечника и измерением.","record_id":"10d366ebce52739133f9f04a9a428f5420525349130ac5ff39973e475b0eefa3","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","source":"Estimate only. The air-core model uses Wheeler’s single-layer approximation and is a rough guide when coil diameter is less than 3× winding length. It omits wire thickness, spacing, nearby metal, frequency, parasitic capacitance and measurement conditions. For a toroid, enter the AL factor from its exact core datasheet; AL and permeability can change with frequency, temperature, DC bias, gap and manufacturing tolerance. Verify any real design with the core manufacturer and measurement.","source_hash":"afb560136b551f41a3012376f29e0acf944d00215a9916e516e2d603237c8159","translation":"Только оценка. Модель воздушного сердечника использует однослойную аппроксимацию Уилера и является приблизительным ориентиром, когда диаметр катушки меньше длины обмотки 3 ×. Она не учитывает толщину проволоки, расстояние, близлежащий металл, частоту, паразитную емкость и условия измерения. Для тороидального, введите коэффициент AL из его точного листа данных сердечника; AL и проницаемость могут изменяться с частотой, температурой, отклонением постоянного тока, зазором и допуском производства. Проверьте любую реальную конструкцию с производителем сердечника и измерением.","truncated":false,"warnings":["back_negation"]}},{"audit":{"approved":false,"auto_usable":false,"back_translation":"Estimate only. The air core model uses a single-layer Wheeler approximation and is an approximate reference when the coil diameter is less than the winding length 3 ×. It does not take into account wire thickness, distance, nearby metal, frequency, parasitic capacitance and measurement conditions. For toroidal, enter the coefficient AL from its accurate core data sheet; AL and permeability may vary with frequency, temperature, DC deviation, gap and manufacturing tolerance. Check any real design with the core manufacturer and measurement.","back_truncated":false,"format":"usefulverse-semantic-audit-v1","native_review":false,"policy":{"allows_publication":false,"claims_native_quality":false,"embedding":{"license":"MIT","repository":"intfloat/multilingual-e5-small","revision":"614241f622f53c4eeff9890bdc4f31cfecc418b3"},"max_tokens":512,"maximum_contradiction":0.2,"minimum_entailment":0.6,"minimum_similarity":0.8,"nli":{"license":"Apache-2.0","repository":"cross-encoder/nli-deberta-v3-small","revision":"fa280